{"_ts": 1791955796.980526, "concerns": [{"id": "internal_consistency-000f45c8", "reviewer": "internal_consistency", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-033-predicting-material-properties-from-comp/specs/001-predicting-material-properties-from-comp/spec.md", "location": "spec.md:FR-005", "text": "FR-005 states the system MUST construct a structure\u2011aware graph, but the unresolved comments explicitly defer FR\u2011005 because no open CIF dataset is available, creating a direct contradiction between a mandatory requirement and a declared deferral.", "round": 1}, {"id": "internal_consistency-962da578", "reviewer": "internal_consistency", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-033-predicting-material-properties-from-comp/specs/001-predicting-material-properties-from-comp/spec.md", "location": "spec.md:FR-006", "text": "FR-006 requires calculation of the performance gap (\u0394R\u00b2) between composition\u2011only and structure\u2011aware models, yet FR\u2011005 (the structure\u2011aware baseline) is deferred, making FR\u2011006 impossible to satisfy.", "round": 1}, {"id": "internal_consistency-1f906323", "reviewer": "internal_consistency", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-033-predicting-material-properties-from-comp/specs/001-predicting-material-properties-from-comp/spec.md", "location": "spec.md:SC-002", "text": "Success Criterion SC-002 demands measurement and reporting of \u0394R\u00b2, but the required baseline (FR\u2011005/FR\u2011006) is deferred, so the criterion cannot be met.", "round": 1}, {"id": "internal_consistency-2ce9c50b", "reviewer": "internal_consistency", "severity": "writing", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-033-predicting-material-properties-from-comp/specs/001-predicting-material-properties-from-comp/spec.md", "location": "spec.md:FR-001", "text": "FR-001 (and several other FRs) reference \u201cUS-1\u201d (e.g., \u201cSee US-1\u201d), but no identifier US\u20111 is defined anywhere in the documen